        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3208:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3316,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "Sexual harassment is also protected under Title VII. This type of harassment is defined as unwelcome sexual",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.4,
          532.1,
          453.5,
          462.6
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
          "boldRatio": 0.2,
          "italicRatio": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3209:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3317,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "advances, requests for sexual favors, and other verbal or physical conduct ofa sexual nature. Two types of",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.4,
          520.7,
          440,
          449.1
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
          "boldRatio": 0,
          "italicRatio": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3210:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3318,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "sexual harassment are recognized. Quid pro quo occurs when a manager makes a sexual demand on a",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.5,
          507.6,
          426.5,
          435.5
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
          "boldRatio": 0.1,
          "italicRatio": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3211:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3319,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "worker, and this demand is perceived as a condition of employment. Actions that create a hostile work",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.1,
          506.4,
          413,
          422.1
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
          "boldRatio": 0.1,
          "italicRatio": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3212:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3320,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "environment are another type ofsexual harassment. These issues have been used in cases of discrimination",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.4,
          531.4,
          399.5,
          408.6
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
          "boldRatio": 0.1,
          "italicRatio": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3213:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3321,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "based on race and religion as well as sex. Since the 1997 case Onca le v. Su n downer Offs hore Services Inc., it",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.8,
          525.5,
          386,
          395.1
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
          "boldRatio": 0,
          "italicRatio": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3214:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3322,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "has been established that sexual harassment undertaken by a member of one sex against a member ofthe",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.8,
          523.8,
          372.5,
          381.6
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
          "boldRatio": 0,
          "italicRatio": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sourceAlias": "L3215:S0",
      "page": 106,
      "ordinal": 3323,
      "pageStratum": "SEEDED_INTERIOR",
      "text": "same sex is actionable under Title VII. In some limited circumstances, employers may also be liable for",
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          72.5,
          502.9,
          359,
          368.1
        ],
        "font": {
          "size": 9,
          "name": "notosans-regular",
